# Telegraf: read-only on sensor telemetry
user telegraf
topic read tele/#
topic read stat/#

# Sensors (shared device account for phase 1; move to per-device users later).
# Tasmota needs tele/ and stat/ for publishing and cmnd/ for receiving commands.
user sensor
topic write tele/#
topic write stat/#
topic read cmnd/#

# Admin: full access for maintenance and Tasmota configuration
user admin
topic readwrite #
